07","x":0.0,"y":4.625,"t":1735978619,"iso":"2025-01-04T08:16:59Z","rt":7,"replies":2,"quotes":1,"likes":41,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"the_beardedsina","author_id":"864968019767943169","text":"Who are the people that can be affected by HMPV\n\nIt commonly affects extremes of ages \nSo children ( especially under 5) and elderly, aged.\n\nPeople with weak immune systems or diseases of the lungs like asthma, COPD ( huge risk factor - Chronic smoking)","in_corpus":true,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":43,"subtree_size":14,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1875456373083042056","conversation_id":"1875456366174990708"},{"id":"2034748376965648591","x":1.0,"y":6.0,"t":1773956791,"iso":"2026-03-19T21:46:31.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"Samfak_","author_id":"1277997793391640585","text":"@the_beardedsina Some COVID variant or what? #lol","in_corpus":false,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":10549.493,"parent_id":"1875456378095202707","conversation_id":"1875456366174990708"},{"id":"1875456385930174958","x":0.0,"y":3.25,"t":1735978621,"iso":"2025-01-04T08:17:01Z","rt":10,"replies":2,"quotes":1,"likes":40,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"the_beardedsina","author_id":"864968019767943169","text":"How does HMPV infection present?\n\nCough\nRunny nose\nStuffy nose\nFever\nSore throat\nWeakness\nBreathlessness \nIn severe cases Pneumonia\n\nOther non specific symptoms https://t.co/juWA7lyWrX","in_corpus":true,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":36,"subtree_size":12,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1875456378095202707","conversation_id":"1875456366174990708"},{"id":"1875586531370598778","x":0.000817,"y":5.0,"t":1736009650,"iso":"2025-01-04T16:54:10Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"quote","niveau":4,"author":"WanjikuKenya","author_id":"1035936692761440257","text":"The Globalist led by @gatesfoundation &amp; @BillGates are at it again to depopulate the world with COVID-19 like virus - Human Metapneumovirus (HMPV). https://t.co/Z5xwjZJ79s","in_corpus":true,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":8.621,"parent_id":"1875456385930174958","conversation_id":"1875586531370598778"},{"id":"1875503988319088748","x":0.000299,"y":4.0,"t":1735989970,"iso":"2025-01-04T11:26:10.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"elmax_official","author_id":"1315021057271701504","text":"@the_beardedsina It’s funny how I have 90% of these symptoms 💀","in_corpus":false,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":3,"dt_root_h":3.154,"parent_id":"1875456385930174958","conversation_id":"1875456366174990708"},{"id":"1875538602635251784","x":0.000516,"y":4.0,"t":1735998223,"iso":"2025-01-04T13:43:43.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":5,"author":"AxcendYT","author_id":"1791637352571346944","text":"@elmax_official @the_beardedsina Bro me too\nI just dey haaaaaaa since 😂😂😂😭😭😭","in_corpus":false,"depth":5,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":5.446,"parent_id":"1875503988319088748","conversation_id":"1875456366174990708"},{"id":"1875867038197125468","x":0.002578,"y":4.0,"t":1736076528,"iso":"2025-01-05T11:28:48.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":6,"author":"elmax_official","author_id":"1315021057271701504","text":"@AxcendYT @the_beardedsina 💔😂","in_corpus":false,"depth":6,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":27.198,"parent_id":"1875538602635251784","conversation_id":"1875456366174990708"},{"id":"1875456399049945385","x":0.0,"y":1.5,"t":1735978624,"iso":"2025-01-04T08:17:04.000Z","rt":6,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":41,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"the_beardedsina","author_id":"864968019767943169","text":"The virus mainly spreads by Droplets which to a large extent is produced by coughing and sneezing \n\nAlso weather conditions are thought to help propagate the spread ( fairly common with some viral infections) https://t.co/OOM0Iwxivj","in_corpus":false,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":26,"subtree_size":7,"dt_root_h":0.002,"parent_id":"1875456385930174958","conversation_id":"1875456366174990708"},{"id":"1875456404066333074","x":0.0,"y":1.5,"t":1735978625,"iso":"2025-01-04T08:17:05.000Z","rt":8,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":59,"relation":"reply","niveau":5,"author":"the_beardedsina","author_id":"864968019767943169","text":"How do we prevent and handle it ?\n\nHandwashing ( protects against lot of diseases)\n\nBed rest\n\nHealthy diet to build immunity \n\nStop smoking\n\nTake enough water\n\nCough etiquette.\n\nNotice persistent symptoms please go to a hospital and talk to a Doctor.","in_corpus":false,"depth":5,"subtree_rt":20,"subtree_size":6,"dt_root_h":0.003,"parent_id":"1875456399049945385","conversation_id":"1875456366174990708"},{"id":"1875456408449425594","x":0.0,"y":1.5,"t":1735978626,"iso":"2025-01-04T08:17:06Z","rt":12,"replies":4,"quotes":0,"likes":48,"relation":"reply","niveau":6,"author":"the_beardedsina","author_id":"864968019767943169","text":"Complications that could happen with HMPV\n\nEven though these happen when Severe\n\nPneumonia\nRecurrent attacks in Asthmatics\nEar infections \nA huge spectrum of lung diseases.\n\nWe can reduce the spread by understanding and knowing what to do.\n\nPlease share and I'd take questions","in_corpus":true,"depth":6,"subtree_rt":12,"subtree_size":5,"dt_root_h":0.003,"parent_id":"1875456404066333074","conversation_id":"1875456366174990708"},{"id":"1875568047114863081","x":0.000701,"y":3.0,"t":1736005243,"iso":"2025-01-04T15:40:43.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":7,"author":"hagioshealthtv","author_id":"1745569216361533440","text":"@the_beardedsina Thanks so much Dr.","in_corpus":false,"depth":7,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":7.396,"parent_id":"1875456408449425594","conversation_id":"1875456366174990708"},{"id":"1875550159104512256","x":0.000589,"y":2.0,"t":1736000978,"iso":"2025-01-04T14:29:38.000Z","rt":0,"replies